    <briefdescription>
<para>This class represents an item in the work list. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The type defines what kind of work needs to be performed when processing the current item. Everything but the <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_type" kindref="compound">Type</ref> and Die fields are optional based on the type. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
